{
  "registered": true,
  "tool": {
    "name": "eplan_placement_update",
    "title": "Move placements on an EPLAN page",
    "description": "Moves same-page symbols/text/lines/rectangles, or independently moves and rotates property text. Read eplan_page_get include_drawings locators. Use moves or property_moves (parent, property_id, property_index, x_mm, y_mm, angle_deg: 0/90/180/270). mm, bottom left, y up. Groups refused. One undo; no-op leaves none. Approval outside scratch; denial: APPROVAL_DENIED. See usage.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "project",
        "page"
      ],
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "required": [
            "moves"
          ],
          "not": {
            "required": [
              "property_moves"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "required": [
            "property_moves"
          ],
          "not": {
            "required": [
              "moves"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "properties": {
        "project": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "page": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "property_moves": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 50,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "parent",
              "property_id",
              "property_index",
              "x_mm",
              "y_mm",
              "angle_deg"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "parent": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/locator"
              },
              "property_id": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 2147483647
              },
              "property_index": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 9999
              },
              "x_mm": {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 10000
              },
              "y_mm": {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 10000
              },
              "angle_deg": {
                "type": "integer",
                "enum": [
                  0,
                  90,
                  180,
                  270
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "moves": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 50,
          "items": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "locator",
                  "x_mm",
                  "y_mm"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "locator": {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/locator"
                  },
                  "x_mm": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 10000
                  },
                  "y_mm": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 10000
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "locator",
                  "delta_mm"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "locator": {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/locator"
                  },
                  "delta_mm": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "minItems": 2,
                    "maxItems": 2,
                    "items": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "minimum": -10000,
                      "maximum": 10000
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "dry_run": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false
        },
        "show_page": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "description": "Open or focus this page in the EPLAN editor before drawing so the user can watch; UI only, no data change."
        },
        "snap_to_grid": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true
        },
        "response_format": {
          "enum": [
            "concise",
            "detailed"
          ],
          "default": "concise"
        }
      },
      "$defs": {
        "locator": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "project",
            "page",
            "type",
            "oid",
            "digest"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "project": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            },
            "page": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            },
            "type": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 2147483647
            },
            "oid": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 9223372036854775807
            },
            "digest": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{64}$"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "outputSchema": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "project",
        "page",
        "execution",
        "dryRun",
        "noOp",
        "gridSize",
        "boundarySource",
        "moves",
        "fingerprint",
        "graphicalChanges",
        "connectionChanges",
        "generation"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "project": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "page": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "execution": {
          "enum": [
            "not_started",
            "committed"
          ]
        },
        "dryRun": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "noOp": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "gridSize": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        },
        "boundarySource": {
          "const": "Page.Size"
        },
        "fingerprint": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "generation": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "pageShown": {
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "hint": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "warning": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "recovered": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "moves": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "locator",
              "parent",
              "before",
              "requested",
              "after",
              "snapped",
              "bounds"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "locator": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/locator"
              },
              "parent": {
                "oneOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "null"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/locator"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "before": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/point"
              },
              "requested": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/point"
              },
              "after": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/point"
              },
              "snapped": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "bounds": {
                "type": "array",
                "minItems": 4,
                "maxItems": 4,
                "items": {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              },
              "propertyId": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "propertyIndex": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "beforeAngle": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "angle": {
                "type": "number"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "graphicalChanges": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "pins",
              "before",
              "after"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "pins": {
                "type": "array",
                "minItems": 2,
                "maxItems": 2,
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "before": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/segment"
              },
              "after": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/segment"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "connectionChanges": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 2,
            "maxItems": 2,
            "items": {
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "$defs": {
        "locator": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "project",
            "page",
            "type",
            "oid",
            "digest"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "project": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            },
            "page": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            },
            "type": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 2147483647
            },
            "oid": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 9223372036854775807
            },
            "digest": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{64}$"
            }
          }
        },
        "point": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 2,
          "maxItems": 2,
          "items": {
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "segment": {
          "type": [
            "array",
            "null"
          ],
          "minItems": 2,
          "maxItems": 2,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/point"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "annotations": {
      "destructiveHint": false,
      "idempotentHint": true,
      "openWorldHint": false,
      "readOnlyHint": false
    }
  },
  "usage": "## Examples\n```json\n{\"project\":\"Line1\",\"page\":\"P\",\"moves\":[{\"locator\":{\"project\":\"scratch-project\",\"page\":\"P\",\"type\":4,\"oid\":1,\"digest\":\"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa\"},\"x_mm\":30,\"y_mm\":30}],\"dry_run\":true}\n```\n```json\n{\"project\":\"Line1\",\"page\":\"P\",\"property_moves\":[{\"parent\":{\"project\":\"scratch-project\",\"page\":\"P\",\"type\":17,\"oid\":1,\"digest\":\"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa\"},\"property_id\":20214,\"property_index\":0,\"x_mm\":60,\"y_mm\":160,\"angle_deg\":90}],\"dry_run\":true}\n```\nUse a complete locator returned by eplan_page_get with include_drawings=true. In a move, supply locator and absolute x_mm/y_mm, or locator and delta_mm:[dx,dy]. Use dry_run=true to preview; omit it to execute the approved absolute plan.\n## Workflow\nRead the complete page, preview, review every following property text and connection change. Zero delta is a no-op. Outside scratch, approval is required; denial returns APPROVAL_DENIED. One Ctrl+Z restores a successful move. Use eplan_connection_generate afterwards to regenerate logical connections; its changes have their own undo step.\n## Fields\nExplicit project/page; moves has 1-50 items. Millimetres, bottom left, y up; default snap_to_grid=true. Deltas resolve to absolute targets before snapping. Do not replay a delta as an absolute plan.\n## Errors\nFor individual property text use property_moves instead of moves: each item has parent (the complete parent drawing locator), property_id, property_index (zero-based parent collection slot), absolute x_mm/y_mm and angle_deg (0/90/180/270). Copy selectors from the child's properties in eplan_page_get include_drawings; its OID alone is shared with the parent. The selected text is undocked; parent and other texts stay unchanged. Readback moves include beforeAngle/angle and before/after page positions. From-layer or non-right-angle source rotations are refused. Groups, unknown bounds and stale selectors fail closed.\nWrite, idempotent absolute plans, full profile. Dry run performs no write or approval. Mid-batch/readback failures roll back the closure without closing an undo step; unprovable restoration returns OUTCOME_UNKNOWN. Logical endpoints are preserved and graphical changes are verified after commit.\n"
}
